Third-party material

- `Sources/LGLanScanner/Resources/oui.plist` is derived from the IEEE Registration
  Authority's public OUI assignments, as redistributed by MMLanScan (Michael Mavris, MIT)
  and lan-scanner (Matheus Gois, MIT), the projects the 0.x releases were built on.
- `Sources/LanScanInternal/LGRoutingTable.c` reproduces the routing-socket message layout
  of Apple's xnu kernel (`bsd/net/route.h`), released under the Apple Public Source
  License 2.0, because the iOS SDK does not ship that header.
